{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"G23 exact merged-SHA independent review receipt, part 1/4 (28 rows). Nonauthor /root reviewed all 112 Dialectal blocks at candidate 7d641e07f8303cf97782c6bc1f544b8244cd3f07; all 32 grouped path blobs are byte-identical at merged Gerrit 3094 SHA 255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8. Every row has directives, semantic preservation, and bloat removal PASS. Full TSV SHA-256 3aa7e03361acb70b0034fbda1fb25a4b52ae67afcbac97936ba076c92320a55c; chunk SHA-256 d5d660acefbcb5e3176acdd028895acdb776e03f95c917fd6aa51e2aab2a61e9.\n\n```tsv\nticket\tstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tdirectives_exact\tsemantic_preservation\tbloat_removal\treviewer_session\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#D:<module>\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:1-21\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:1-5\tCloud stores ADF documents, while Data Center stores wiki text. RichTextCodec separates fitting, round-trip normalization, wire encoding, and inbound decoding. Cloud fitting measures serialized ADF. The Cloud send path uses fitting and normalization, while the description sanitizer fits only.\t149\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#D:test_over_limit_text_is_fitted_and_marked\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:77-84\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:59-59\tFitting an over-limit value keeps a terminal marker within the cap.\t68\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#D:test_wiki_over_limit_value_ends_with_the_marker_and_fits_the_cap\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:96-102\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:71-71\tWiki fitting keeps the terminal marker within WIKI_DESCRIPTION_LIMIT.\t49\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#D:test_adf_over_limit_value_ends_with_the_marker_within_the_serialized_cap\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:110-112\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:79-79\tADF fitting keeps the terminal marker inside the serialized-document cap.\t31\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#D:test_normalize_outbound_equals_decode_of_to_wire\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:164-171\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:117-117\tEvery codec preserves the law normalize_outbound(t) == decode_inbound(to_wire(t)).\t55\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#C:Both codecs append\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:68-71\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:52-53\t# Both codecs use the same visible truncation marker. Keep the wiki and ADF # constants equal without importing Cloud code into the shared layer.\t37\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py#C:The codec law\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:133-149\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_codec.py:100-102\t# The comment differ compares decoded Jira wire output with normalized local # text. Their equality prevents duplicate comments and lost Jira formatting. # normalize_outbound(t) == decode_inbound(to_wire(t)).\t146\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py#D:<module>\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:1-17\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:1-5\tLossy rich-text output needs state-based echo suppression. Compare local text with the last-synced baseline in raw form or after outbound normalization. That prevents repeated writes of unchanged rendered wiki text, allows a changed body through, and preserves plain-codec behavior.\t155\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py#D:test_lossy_baseline_compare_local_normalized\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:79-83\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:67-67\tA normalized local body matching the baseline does not re-emit.\t36\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py#D:test_legacy_body_upgrades_once\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:111-116\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:95-95\tA body synced before rich-text cutover upgrades once and then converges.\t48\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py#D:test_cutover_does_not_mass_rewrite_already_synced_bodies\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:127-134\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_rich_text_echo_suppression.py:106-106\tEnabling rich mode does not rewrite descriptions already synchronized under the baseline.\t63\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py#D:<module>\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py:1-20\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py:1-5\tPreview and dry-run differ passes must perform no remote recovery writes. Pending-binding recovery runs only for an unscoped pass with persist enabled. Keyed-pending recovery still writes identity on a normal pass. BindingRecovery tests separately guard keyed no-search and keyless absence thresholds.\t159\t41\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py#D:_seed_keyed_pending\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py:53-59\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py:38-38\tSeed a keyed-pending binding in the store for recovery checks.\t45\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py#D:test_live_pass_still_performs_recovery_writes\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py:124-126\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_differs_recovery_no_write.py:103-103\tAn unscoped persisted pass writes identity during keyed recovery.\t35\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py#D:<module>\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:1-22\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:1-5\tA mid-pass lease loss aborts reconciliation and exits for rescheduling. ReconcileLockLost maps to exit 75, which the bridge workflow treats as a retryable pass. An unrelated failure still exits 1. The lock-loss abort keeps the no-overlap invariant while allowing the next scheduled run to retry.\t198\t45\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py#D:_lock_lost_cls\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:37-49\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:20-20\tResolve the production ReconcileLockLost class so the test raises its exact exception.\t105\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py#D:test_lock_lost_mid_pass_exits_reschedule_not_error\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:78-83\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:49-49\tA lost mid-pass lease reports rescheduling and exits 75 rather than 1.\t46\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py#D:test_generic_failure_still_exits_one\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:108-112\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_run_pass_lock_lost_exit.py:74-74\tOnly lock loss is reclassified. An unrelated pass failure still exits 1.\t30\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:<module>\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:1-30\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:1-6\tTransition replay follows recorded status events when a direct Jira hop fails. Use chronological STATUS events and forward-mapped Jira names to resume from the current state. Never invent an unrecorded hop. A rejected hop falls back to drift, while transient transport failures propagate. Tests observe transition calls and the update result through \t231\t56\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:_write_status_event\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:74-82\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:46-46\tAppend a timestamped STATUS event with the target local status and recorded prior status.\t80\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:_make_tracker\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:109-113\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:73-73\tWrite local status hops in order under the ticket tracker directory.\t32\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:_point_config_at\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:126-133\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:86-86\tPoint the reconciler tracker-directory resolver at the test store.\t43\t9\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:_FakeTransport\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:140-154\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:93-93\tRecord transition calls and expose configured Jira status and hop failures.\t112\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:test_replay_resume_point_matches_in_jira_name_space\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:216-221\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:155-155\tResume on forward-mapped Jira status and send only the remaining Done hop.\t40\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:test_replay_duplicate_jira_name_anchors_on_last_occurrence\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:236-241\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:170-170\tWhen two local hops map to In Progress, resume after its last recorded occurrence.\t58\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:test_replay_never_invents_unrecorded_hops\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:256-260\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:185-185\tA direct open-to-closed trail cannot invent an intermediate In Progress hop.\t44\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:test_replay_aborts_and_drifts_on_illegal_hop\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:303-312\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:228-228\tA rejected intermediate hop aborts replay and leaves update_one in drift.\t75\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py#D:test_recorded_status_hops_orders_by_filename\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:337-345\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transition_replay.py:253-253\tRead STATUS targets in filename order and forward-map each local status to Jira.\t55\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792818257049713136,"uuid":"e3dd3d35-05c6-4eeb-85df-ffcbe8d2f492"}